#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improving Expectation Values: Propagated Noise Absorption (PNA)"
msgstr "Pagpapabuti ng Expectation Values: Propagated Noise Absorption (PNA)"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-"
"addons/pna/01_generate_noise_mitigating_observable.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-"
"addons/pna/01_generate_noise_mitigating_observable.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this tutorial, we will learn how to leverage the latest tools in the "
"Qiskit ecosystem to implement a fully customizable, error mitigated "
"workflow. We will introduce the PNA technique and use it to mitigate gate "
"errors. We will also use TREX to mitigate readout errors and post-selection "
"to mitigate errors not captured in the learned noise model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa tutorial na ito, matututuhan natin kung paano gamitin ang pinakabagong "
"mga tool sa Qiskit ecosystem upang mag-implementa ng isang ganap na "
"customizable, error mitigated workflow. Ipakikilala natin ang teknik na PNA "
"at gagamitin ito upang i-mitigate ang gate errors. Gagamitin din natin ang "
"TREX upang i-mitigate ang readout errors at post-selection upang i-mitigate "
"ang mga error na hindi nakuha sa learned noise model.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Outline**\n"
"- Give a brief overview of ``PNA``\n"
"- Create a Trotterized quantum circuit and observable. Transpile it to the backend and include post-selection measurements.\n"
"- Use ``samplomatic`` to twirl layers of 2Q gates and measurements. Find unique 2Q layers to reduce noise learning cost.\n"
"- Use ``NoiseLearnerV3`` to learn the error model affecting the 2Q gates and measurements.\n"
"- Use ``qiskit-addon-pna`` to generate a noise-mitigating observable\n"
"- Use ``qiskit-ibm-runtime.Executor`` primitive to generate the raw QPU samples reflecting every shot for every twirling randomization and measured basis\n"
"- Use ``qiskit-addon-utils`` to post-process the data into a mitigated expectation value.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Outline**\n"
"- Magbigay ng maikling overview ng ``PNA``\n"
"- Lumikha ng isang Trotterized quantum circuit at observable. I-transpile ito sa backend at isama ang post-selection measurements.\n"
"- Gamitin ang ``samplomatic`` upang i-twirl ang mga layer ng 2Q gates at measurements. Hanapin ang mga unique 2Q layer upang bawasan ang noise learning cost.\n"
"- Gamitin ang ``NoiseLearnerV3`` upang matutuhan ang error model na nakakaapekto sa 2Q gates at measurements.\n"
"- Gamitin ang ``qiskit-addon-pna`` upang bumuo ng noise-mitigating observable\n"
"- Gamitin ang ``qiskit-ibm-runtime.Executor`` primitive upang bumuo ng raw QPU samples na nagpapakita ng bawat shot para sa bawat twirling randomization at measured basis\n"
"- Gamitin ang ``qiskit-addon-utils`` upang i-post-process ang data para maging isang mitigated expectation value.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What is propagated noise absorption (PNA)? {#what-is-propagated-noise-"
"absorption-pna}"
msgstr ""
"Ano ang propagated noise absorption (PNA)? {#what-is-propagated-noise-"
"absorption-pna}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"***A technique for mitigating gate errors by propagating the observable through the inverse noise channel affecting 2-qubit gates, resulting in a noise-mitigating observable.***\n"
"The 2Q gates in the experiment we want to run will be affected by substantial noise.\n"
"![Noisy experiment](/img/qiskit-addons/images/noisy_expt.png)\n"
"If we learn the noise model, we can apply its inverse and cancel the noise.\n"
"![Noise-mitigated experiment](/img/qiskit-addons/images/noise_mitigated_expt.png)\n"
"Instead of implementing the inverse noise channel by sampling it on the QPU as in PEC, we can implement it classically in the measured observable using Pauli propagation. This results in a more complex observable which, when measured, has the effect of mitigating the learned gate noise.\n"
"![PNA overview](/img/qiskit-addons/images/pna_overview.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"***Isang teknik para sa pagmiminimize ng gate errors sa pamamagitan ng pag-propagate ng observable sa inverse noise channel na nakakaapekto sa 2-qubit gates, na nagreresulta sa isang noise-mitigating observable.***\n"
"Ang 2Q gates sa eksperimentong gusto nating patakbuhin ay maaapektuhan ng malaking ingay (noise).\n"
"![Noisy experiment](/img/qiskit-addons/images/noisy_expt.png)\n"
"Kung matututuhan natin ang noise model, maaari nating ilapat ang inverse nito at kanselahin ang noise.\n"
"![Noise-mitigated experiment](/img/qiskit-addons/images/noise_mitigated_expt.png)\n"
"Sa halip na i-implementa ang inverse noise channel sa pamamagitan ng pag-sample nito sa QPU tulad ng sa PEC, maaari nating i-implementa ito nang klasikal sa measured observable gamit ang Pauli propagation. Ito ay nagreresulta sa isang mas masalimuot na observable na, kapag na-measure, ay may epekto ng pag-mitigate sa learned gate noise.\n"
"![PNA overview](/img/qiskit-addons/images/pna_overview.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate the mirrored Trotter circuit and observable {#generate-the-"
"mirrored-trotter-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr ""
"Bumuo ng mirrored Trotter circuit at observable {#generate-the-mirrored-"
"trotter-circuit-and-observable}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For this experiment, we will study the time dynamics of a 30-site kicked "
"Ising model on a 1D spin chain. The Hamiltonian considered is:\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa eksperimentong ito, pag-aaralan natin ang time dynamics ng isang "
"30-site kicked Ising model sa isang 1D spin chain. Ang Hamiltonian na "
"isinasaalang-alang ay:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$H = -J\\sum\\limits_{\\langle i,j \\rangle} Z_iZ_j + h\\sum\\limits_iX_i$,\n"
msgstr "$H = -J\\sum\\limits_{\\langle i,j \\rangle} Z_iZ_j + h\\sum\\limits_iX_i$,\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where $J>0$ describes the coupling of nearest-neighbor spins, $i<j$, and the"
" global transverse field, $h$, is set to $\\frac{\\pi}{8}$. The further $h$ "
"is from a Clifford angle (i.e. $\\theta=n\\frac{\\pi}{2}, n \\in "
"\\mathbb{Z}$), the more difficult it becomes to propagate the anti-noise "
"generators through the circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"kung saan ang $J>0$ ay naglalarawan ng coupling ng nearest-neighbor spins, "
"$i<j$, at ang global transverse field, $h$, ay itinakda sa "
"$\\frac{\\pi}{8}$. Habang mas malayo ang $h$ sa isang Clifford angle (i.e. "
"$\\theta=n\\frac{\\pi}{2}, n \\in \\mathbb{Z}$), mas mahirap ipropagate ang "
"anti-noise generators sa pamamagitan ng circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For the choice of observable, we will consider the average single-site "
"magnetization, $\\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\langle z_i \\rangle$, where "
"$N$ is the number of sites.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa pagpili ng observable, isasaalang-alang natin ang average single-"
"site magnetization, $\\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\langle z_i \\rangle$, "
"kung saan ang $N$ ay ang bilang ng mga site.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/pna/01-generate-noise-"
"mitigating-observable/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/pna/01-generate-noise-"
"mitigating-observable/output_1.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, we will choose a chain of qubits on ``ibm_kingston`` that report low "
"error rates and transpile the circuit to the backend.\n"
msgstr ""
"Susunod, pipili tayo ng chain ng mga qubit sa ``ibm_kingston`` na nag-uulat "
"ng mababang error rates at i-transpile natin ang circuit sa backend.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/pna/01-generate-noise-"
"mitigating-observable/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/pna/01-generate-noise-"
"mitigating-observable/output_2.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Twirl the 2-qubit gate layers and measurements and find unique layers "
"{#twirl-the-2-qubit-gate-layers-and-measurements-and-find-unique-layers}"
msgstr ""
"I-twirl ang mga 2-qubit gate layer at measurements at hanapin ang mga unique"
" layer {#twirl-the-2-qubit-gate-layers-and-measurements-and-find-unique-"
"layers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here we ensure the pass manager annotates the boxes with ``Twirl`` and "
"``InjectNoise`` annotations, which allow us to learn the noise which will "
"affect our circuit and associate that noise with its corresponding circuit "
"layer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dito tinitiyak natin na ang pass manager ay nag-aannotate sa mga box gamit "
"ang ``Twirl`` at ``InjectNoise`` annotations, na nagpapahintulot sa atin na "
"matutuhan ang noise na makakaapekto sa ating circuit at iugnay ang noise na "
"iyon sa kaukulang circuit layer nito.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"``enable_gates/enable_measure: True``: Box all 2q gate layers and terminal "
"measurements. Single qubit gates will be left-dressed within the boxes.\n"
msgstr ""
"``enable_gates/enable_measure: True``: I-box ang lahat ng 2q gate layers at "
"terminal measurements. Ang single qubit gates ay ila-left-dressed sa loob ng"
" mga box.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"``measure_annotations: all`` Include `Twirl` and `ChangeBasis` annotations "
"on the measurement box\n"
msgstr ""
"``measure_annotations: all`` Isama ang `Twirl` at `ChangeBasis` annotations "
"sa measurement box\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"``twirling_strategy: active``: Twirl all active qubits in each box "
"containing entangling gates\n"
msgstr ""
"``twirling_strategy: active``: I-twirl ang lahat ng active qubits sa bawat "
"box na naglalaman ng entangling gates\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"``inject_noise_targets: gates``: ``InjectNoise`` annotations should be added"
" to all ``Twirl``-annotated boxes containing entangling gates\n"
msgstr ""
"``inject_noise_targets: gates``: Ang ``InjectNoise`` annotations ay dapat "
"idagdag sa lahat ng ``Twirl``-annotated boxes na naglalaman ng entangling "
"gates\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"``inject_noise_strategy: uniform_modification``: All of the noise layers "
"should be scaled equivalently.\n"
msgstr ""
"``inject_noise_strategy: uniform_modification``: Lahat ng noise layers ay "
"dapat i-scale nang pantay-pantay.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/pna/01-generate-noise-"
"mitigating-observable/output_3.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/pna/01-generate-noise-"
"mitigating-observable/output_3.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate the template circuit and samplex, define how the circuit will be "
"sampled {#generate-the-template-circuit-and-samplex-define-how-the-circuit-"
"will-be-sampled}"
msgstr ""
"Bumuo ng template circuit at samplex, tukuyin kung paano isasagawa ang pag-"
"sample ng circuit {#generate-the-template-circuit-and-samplex-define-how-"
"the-circuit-will-be-sampled}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here we also add spectator and post-selection measurements, which are needed"
" to perform post-selection on the samples output from ``Executor``.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dito din natin idinadagdag ang spectator at post-selection measurements, na "
"kailangan upang magsagawa ng post-selection sa mga sample na output mula sa "
